Subject: [PATCH 09/13] customkimi: refresh OpenRouter model limits and efforts
 at startup

Aliases whose endpoint is https://openrouter.ai/api/v1 take context and output limits and reasoning efforts from OpenRouter's public model list (no key sent), using the CloseRouter refresh rules. Runs as branch 1.6 of refreshProviderModels.
